  "title": "BLDC Motor controller with encoder interface",
  "content": "<p>Hello,</p><p>I am looking for a BLDC motor controller with Hall sensor and Encoder interface. Hall sensor is used for commutation and Encoder will be used for position control. I could not find a motor controller with above mentioned interface. </p><p>Can you suggest a suitable controller?</p><p>Thanks,</p><p>Anand</p>",
