      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"108505\">@Anand369</user-mention>,</p><p>The majority of inverters or power boards have one connector used for encoders or Hall sensors.<br/><span style=\"color:#002052;\">EVLSERVO1 inverter board or STDES-LVHP01/STEVAL-LVLP01 power boards have two connectors </span>to manage Encoder and Hall sensors at the same time.</p></div>"
